.TH MYSTRNCPY 3 "September 2026" "libmyutils 1.0" "libmyutils Manual"
.SH NAME
mystrncpy \- copy a bounded number of characters from a string
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include "mystrfunctions.h"

int mystrncpy(char *dest, const char *src, int n);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B mystrncpy()
function copies at most
.I n
characters from the string
.I src
into
.I dest ,
and always terminates
.I dest
with a null byte. The destination buffer must have room for at least
.I n
+ 1 characters.
.SH RETURN VALUE
On success, returns the number of characters copied. Returns \-1 if
.I dest
or
.I src
is NULL, or if
.I n
is negative.
